  "published": "2026-07-02T20:20:40.75Z",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.19: Click a step to see its full inputs in a new details pane (all parameters, wrapped values, pretty-printed fetchXml); HTML export now embeds a crisp vector SVG diagram, a collapsible step tree with per-step details and expand/collapse all; fixed oversized text in exported diagrams and clipped long titles. 1.0.18: Crossing reduction in the layout - child actions are now ordered under their parents so connectors no longer cross. 1.0.17: Orthogonal connectors with lane separation and readable branch labels, fit-to-width auto-scaling preview, SVG export (Visio/Mural compatible), name filter boxes, flow list shows Created On/Created By/Modified By/Owner/Scope. 1.0.15: Add summary and release notes, remove SPDX license element for Tool Library compatibility. 1.0.0: Initial release - two-tab UI for Power Automate flows and classic workflows, GDI+ process maps, PDF and HTML export.",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": false,
  "summary": "List Classic Workflows and Power Automate flows from Dataverse and render visual process maps, exportable to PDF, HTML or SVG.",
